    "signature": "fn deserialize_stream<'a>(input: impl Stream<Item = datafusion_common::Result<bytes::Bytes>> + Unpin + Send + 'a, deserializer: impl BatchDeserializer<bytes::Bytes> + 'a) -> futures::stream::BoxStream<'a, datafusion_common::Result<::arrow::array::RecordBatch, arrow::error::ArrowError>>",
    "docs": "Deserializes a stream of bytes into a stream of [`RecordBatch`] objects using the\nprovided deserializer.\n\nReturns a boxed stream of `Result<RecordBatch, ArrowError>`. The stream yields [`RecordBatch`]\nobjects as they are produced by the deserializer, or an [`ArrowError`] if an error\noccurs while polling the input or deserializing.",
